1
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:13,117
From a factory in China to a customer in Brazil, an import takes dozens of handoffs.

2
00:00:14,287 --> 00:00:17,475
Suppliers, agencies, freight, customs, carriers.

3
00:00:17,635 --> 00:00:20,728
Each one in a different inbox, spreadsheet and chat.

4
00:00:21,898 --> 00:00:25,039
The Wellmix Portal brings them all into one workflow.

5
00:00:26,209 --> 00:00:29,311
Every step has an owner, a deadline and a status.

6
00:00:30,481 --> 00:00:33,947
Every message, photo and document stays with the order.

7
00:00:35,117 --> 00:00:39,905
Each partner sees only its own part, in Portuguese, English or Chinese.

8
00:00:41,075 --> 00:00:45,628
Inspections, samples and shipping documents are checked before the cargo moves.

9
00:00:46,798 --> 00:00:51,074
And management sees what is late, what is next and who is responsible.

10
00:00:52,244 --> 00:00:55,510
Wellmix. Imports from order to delivery, in one place.
